@format 1
@id processing.stop
@title Stop processing
@area Processing
@entry input
@summary Active work is returned to the queue and this runner owns no claims.
@flow TB
@related processing.run-job
@tag processing
@tag stop

@alias runner = Cadroue.ShellEngine.LRunner

[input] Stop processing command <input>
- Receive the worklist control command @ runner.LRunnerCancel(...)
> apply

[apply] Change runner state <process>
- Cancel worker loops, resume suspended processes before killing them, clear leases and partial outputs, and release owned claims @ runner.LRunnerCancel(...)
> result

[result] Runner state changed <output>
=Active work is returned to the queue and this runner owns no claims.
